     "text": "How to apply for roles",
     "spans": [],
     "direction": "ltr"
    }
   ],
   "title_alignment": "left",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "To apply for any advertised roles, please download our application pack and the relevant job description for the role. The application pack will instruct what to send to recruitment@thec3uk to apply for the role. The application pack also details our commitment to safer recruitment, and we will take all necessary steps to ensure the safeguarding and well-being of children and vulnerable adults throughout our selection process.",
